[0.405, "o", "[2026-05-26] PLAN CREATED\r\n- Spec read: Add a Quick Start section to README.md (GitHub issue #6)\r\n- Existing README audited: commands already exist in \"What this app does\" section but not as a dedicated Quick Start section\r\n- Project structure reviewed: FastAPI app at src/app/main.py, pyproject.toml confirmed pip install -e . and uvicorn src.app.main:app --reload are correct\r\n- implementation_plan.json created with 1 phase, 3 subtasks\r\n\r\nNEXT STEP: Execute subtask 1.2 — insert ## Quick Start section into README.md\r\n  [x] 1.2: Insert a '## Quick Start' section into README.md immediately after the opening description paragraph. The section must show the three commands in a bash code block: (1) pip install -e ., (2) uvicorn src.app.main:app --reload, (3) curl http://localhost:8000/ with expected output. (91839d54)\r\n  [x] 1.3: Verified README.md — all acceptance criteria pass: Quick Start heading present, single bash code block with all 3 commands, expected output comment included, surrounding sections intact.\r\n  [x] 1.3: Re-read the updated README.md and confirm: (a) Quick Start section is present with correct heading, (b) all three commands are in a single bash code block, (c) expected output comment is included, (d) surrounding sections are intact and not corrupted. (91839d54)\r\n"]
