[0.405, "o", "# QA Validation Report\r\n\r\n**Spec**: 001-gh6-document-the-quick-start-in-readme\r\n**Date**: 2026-05-26\r\n**QA Agent Session**: 1\r\n**QA Engineer**: Morgan (Senior QA)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n| Category | Status | Details |\r\n|----------|--------|---------|\r\n| Subtasks Complete | ✓ | 3/3 completed |\r\n| Files Changed | ✓ | Only README.md (as required) |\r\n| Section Heading | ✓ | `## Quick Start` present at correct location |\r\n| Command 1: pip install | ✓ | Present and technically accurate |\r\n| Command 2: uvicorn | ✓ | Correct module path `src.app.main:app` |\r\n| Command 3: curl | ✓ | Correct URL and expected output |\r\n| Expected Output Comment | ✓ | `# {\"app\":\"aifactory-demo\"}` matches actual API response |\r\n| Pre-existing Sections | ✓ | All 4 original sections intact and unchanged |\r\n| Code Block Syntax | ✓ | Uses `bash` syntax highlighting |\r\n| Placement | ✓ | Inserted immediately after intro paragraph, before \"What this app does\" |\r\n| Security Review | ✓ | No issues (documentation only) |\r\n| Regression Check | ✓ | No content removed; additions only |\r\n"]
[2.003, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m━━━ Step 8 — the result ━━━\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.005, "o", "\u001b[1mWhat the developer sees in the portal:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  • Task status:    \u001b[32mHuman Review\u001b[0m (plan + code + QA all complete)\r\n  • Worktree:       isolated branch with the changes\r\n  • Action:         click \"Merge to main\" or \"Create PR\" — done\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mTotal developer keystrokes:\u001b[0m\r\n  • 1 conversation in Claude Code\r\n  • 1 \u001b[36m/handover\u001b[0m\r\n  • 1 plan approval in the portal\r\n  • 1 \"Merge to main\" click after reviewing the diff\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mTotal developer wait time:\u001b[0m\r\n  A few minutes while the agent builds — or step away and come back.\r\n\r\n"]
[3.003, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m━━━ Done — that's the AIFactory handover workflow ━━━\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
